Subject: [PATCH] Own repeat/bilinear sampling for main-textured shapes

Texture-only binding left unrelated unit0 sampler objects active. Their state
superseded texture wrap requests, and the post-draw unbind made later instances
fall back to the framebuffer texture's nearest filter. Bind an instance-owned
repeat/linear sampler on every main-textured fill, including both geometry passes.
Keep named-image descriptor samplers and stop mutating their texture parameters.

MilkDrop3 code/vis_milk2/milkdropfs.cpp restores wrap/linear stage state before
custom shapes (WarpedBlit_Shaders -> RestoreShaderParams -> DrawCustomShapes).
Khronos GLES3 glBindSampler specifies that bound sampler state supersedes texture
state; unbinding alone would activate nearest filtering here.
ProjectM TV fix against upstream 4.1.7 plus patches 0001-0044.

diff --git a/src/libprojectM/MilkdropPreset/CustomShape.cpp b/src/libprojectM/MilkdropPreset/CustomShape.cpp
--- a/src/libprojectM/MilkdropPreset/CustomShape.cpp
+++ b/src/libprojectM/MilkdropPreset/CustomShape.cpp
@@ -389,11 +389,8 @@
             {
                 // No "image" texture (or not found): the main texture.
                 assert(!m_presetState.mainTexture.expired());
-                m_presetState.mainTexture.lock()->Bind(0);
-            }
-
-            glTexParameteri(GL_TEXTURE_2D, GL_TEXTURE_WRAP_S, GL_REPEAT);
-            glTexParameteri(GL_TEXTURE_2D, GL_TEXTURE_WRAP_T, GL_REPEAT);
+                m_presetState.mainTexture.lock()->Bind(0, m_mainTextureSampler);
+            }
 
             glBindVertexArray(m_vaoIdTextured);
             if (m_geometryTargets) {
diff --git a/src/libprojectM/MilkdropPreset/CustomShape.hpp b/src/libprojectM/MilkdropPreset/CustomShape.hpp
--- a/src/libprojectM/MilkdropPreset/CustomShape.hpp
+++ b/src/libprojectM/MilkdropPreset/CustomShape.hpp
@@ -134,6 +134,7 @@
     bool m_quadBorders{false};                                 //!< This frame draws outlines as quads (reference size set, line program usable).
     LineStyle m_borderStyle;                                   //!< Outline width, passes and pass offsets this frame (quad lines).
     bool m_linesBegun{false};                                  //!< LineRenderer::Begin() called for this batch.
+    Renderer::Sampler::Ptr m_mainTextureSampler{std::make_shared<Renderer::Sampler>(GL_REPEAT, GL_LINEAR)}; //!< Main-textured shapes use repeat/bilinear independently of previous GL state.
     Renderer::TextureSamplerDescriptor m_imageTexture; //!< The "image" texture, looked up once per frame.
     bool m_imageLookedUp{false};
     bool m_texturedShaderReady{false}; //!< Textured shader uniforms set in this frame.
